        },
        {
          "literal": "That is enough for now.",
          "when_unavailable": "hide",
          "conditions": [],
          "actions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "d604": {
      "line": {
        "literal": "If the party falls, the breach will not close by itself. The void will continue to spread, and whatever Jahil left sealed may find a road into our world. I do not say this to frighten you. I say it because I have seen a small wound become a disaster when no one guarded it."
      },
